{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e55a595f4497e6399a202380ff677c7e9d8140c86755d8466a032c1d43173eeb", "ja": "（千早がブログを更新してくれていた。\nまだ試着中のようだし、一声かけておこう）", "zh": "（千早更新了博客。\n看起来还在试穿，我先去跟她打声招呼吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "14c68fb8a8f12f6494b939e1c68493efc76ba0ea33a8b2af5ca000385a691edf", "ja": "……うん、やっぱりこのままが、一番素敵な気が\nする……。あとで{$P$}に……", "zh": "……嗯，果然还是这样最漂亮……。待会儿再跟{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4acd1be1e1a8ebf6414dee04a7ae2fcfc5449a8e3077b6a69e54fc61769e53c6", "ja": "千早、ちょっと……って、あれ？\n今、俺のこと呼んだかな？", "zh": "千早，等一下……咦？刚才是在叫我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "bbcac8bde16857428fe4a5f1ab416f845921d2f30fc5b77ebd693deb98ffba60", "ja": "{$P$}！？　び、びっくりした……\nいえ、別に呼んだわけではなかったのですが……。", "zh": "{$P$}！？吓、吓了我一跳……\n不，我其实并没有叫您……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "42bfaf801c87521740276747d6bac7f4cf937fd9a8d5f0dfe32568df50428392", "ja": "衣装を着てみたので、確認をしてほしくて。\nそうしたら、突然{$P$}の声が……", "zh": "我试穿了衣装，想请你帮我确认一下。\n就在那时，突然听到了{$P$}的声音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9f739df6a9614d5adb38ddbee36a98f102063a8769dea02181faa180fdb47097", "ja": "ああ、なるほどそうだったのか。驚かせてごめん。\nちょうどタイミングが重なったんだな。", "zh": "啊，原来是这么回事。吓到你了，抱歉。\n刚好碰上了同一时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "b7f1749b67eaaf3c3436951b6887d17b9fe6ce9de3ed15779bae02eebfc14858", "ja": "タイミング……？　もしかして、\n{$P$}も私に何か用事が？", "zh": "时机……？难道说，{$P$}也有事要找我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1007_p", "source_sha256": "55035bdeb84a0c8f43ef2c78c109d24c56ed8e05f22a0250e65b8871b0f644ec", "ja": "ああ、更新されたブログを見たんだ。ありがとう。\n衣装もすごく似合ってた……というか、似合ってるぞ！", "zh": "啊，我看到更新后的博客了。谢谢你。\n那套服装也特别适合你……不对，应该说现在也很适合你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "b87a543a02f7784146ac6a37a5d1e2baddf9121e3308f4de86013cbb28aa759c", "ja": "……良かった。\n実は、少しだけ心配していたんです。", "zh": "……太好了。\n其实，我刚才还有点担心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1009_p", "source_sha256": "08881fb30b9dec64f581e83b770010bd61d5e60e182612ba8c701ad66ea0d2ea", "ja": "心配？　なにがだ？", "zh": "担心？担心什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "360212a987ecafbf9d63a7c2af42c18429c58b48d36c1ae42e3f92769412430d", "ja": "先ほどまで、音無さんと青羽さんがいたんですが、\n私のドレス姿を見たら、音無さんが……", "zh": "刚才音无小姐和青羽小姐还在这里，\n看到我穿礼服的样子后，音无小姐她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "ba73a7359335d5a8d646b5a35b417facdb250e791c0ab83dfcba66d960482e31", "ja": "「千早ちゃんの晴れ舞台なんだから、ここからいろいろ\n手をいれましょ♪」なんて張り切ってくださって……。", "zh": "“这可是千早的大喜之日，之后得从各方面\n好好修整一下呢♪”她这么说着，显得干劲十足……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "88d58951b72d63f466e36f4d01e90edacf6d41806e2a2a1b4310869a245c0f36", "ja": "青羽さんにも、「衣装の手直しなら任せてください！」\nと、言っていただきました。", "zh": "青羽小姐也对我说：“服装需要修改的话就请交给我！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a69f9fc8b1628d12115892cba915fb1361bccba7b674981d01a59ccfae9ed8ff", "ja": "……？　でもその衣装、ブログに載せてたのと、\nとくに変わってないみたいだけど。", "zh": "……？不过那件服装，看起来和博客上登的\n并没有什么变化啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "497c7cd6e693179126498d6bf82c21bf61fdee3f78659775dca9c764e345ef8d", "ja": "はい、断ってしまったんです……。きっとおふたりなら\n素敵なアレンジをしてくれるとは思ったのですが……。", "zh": "是的，我拒绝了……我想如果是你们两位，一定能做出很棒的改编，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "31a5b0f77290508e1b2dc15be0753f3e25031f6206cb3bb468f3e18661312290", "ja": "{$P$}が、私のために用意して\nくださったこのドレスには……手を入れたくなくて。", "zh": "我不想对{$P$}为我准备的这条裙子……动任何手脚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d8d317677ae1ded44942e6ee50a71acaf3a5fff85483aaa22c77123894ac8c34", "ja": "千早……。", "zh": "千早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "8ee077067a14478b6755e7fef20a650715721b540cb5396aaad82c78c8459442", "ja": "でも、断ったあとで、本当に断って良かったのか、\n自分勝手な考えだったのでは、と少し不安になって。", "zh": "可是，拒绝之后，我有些不安，不知道自己这样拒绝真的好吗，会不会只是太自我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "58655b947d392543787d550764cfebecb87734a2e5e8994e1c9a9737ecc811ad", "ja": "だから、似合っていると言ってもらえて\n本当に、嬉しかったです。ありがとうございます！", "zh": "所以，能听到你说很适合我，\n我真的非常开心。谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0234_1019_p", "source_sha256": "af842ad70e8dbe9d2f442433632229989f776275864fc1e16acc44a30490bc4b", "ja": "（そう言って笑う千早は本当に綺麗だ。\nこの衣装を贈る事ができて、良かった！）", "zh": "千早说着这话时的笑容真的很美。能把这套服装送给她，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
